          ],
          "prompt": "将以下故事文本转换为分镜镜头JSON格式，每个分镜包含：\n- copy: 文案文本\n- prompt: 画面提示词\n\n请返回一个分镜数组，格式如下：\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"copy\": \"文案内容\",\n    \"prompt\": \"画面描述\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n故事文本：{{ __data__[\"node_1781500461235_start\"].story }}",
          "agent": "你是一个专业的影视分镜设计师，擅长将故事文本转换为视觉化的分镜镜头。你需要分析故事内容，提取关键场景，并为每个场景生成适合的画面提示词。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "node_1781515192321_x5xihr",
        "type": "run_code",
        "label": "解析JSON",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 0
        },
        "data": {
          "code": "async function main({ params, context }) {\n  const resultStr = String(params.agentResult || '').trim();\n\n  const parseScenes = (text) => {\n    const parsed = JSON.parse(text);\n    return { scenes: Array.isArray(parsed) ? parsed : [] };\n  };\n\n  const extractFirstJsonArray = (text) => {\n    const start = text.indexOf('[');\n    if (start === -1) return null;\n    let depth = 0;\n    let inString = false;\n    let escaped = false;\n\n    for (let i = start; i < text.length; i++) {\n      const ch = text[i];\n      if (inString) {\n        if (escaped) {\n          escaped = false;\n        } else if (ch === '\\\\') {\n          escaped = true;\n        } else if (ch === '\"') {\n          inString = false;\n        }\n        continue;\n      }\n      if (ch === '\"') {\n        inString = true;\n      } else if (ch === '[') {\n        depth++;\n      } else if (ch === ']') {\n        depth--;\n        if (depth === 0) return text.slice(start, i + 1);\n      }\n    }\n    return null;\n  };\n\n  try {\n    return parseScenes(resultStr);\n  } catch (e) {\n    const blockMatch = resultStr.match(/```(?:json)?\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)\\s*```/);\n    if (blockMatch) return parseScenes(blockMatch[1]);\n\n    const firstArray = extractFirstJsonArray(resultStr);\n    if (firstArray) return parseScenes(firstArray);\n\n    throw new Error('无法解析JSON结果');\n  }\n}",
          "outputs": [
            {
              "key": "scenes",
              "type": "any[]"
            }
          ],
          "inputFields": [
